        "explanation": "Explanation:\nExample case 1: Hasan can choose the following sequences of indices:\n\n(1)(1)(1): the input of the machine is (\"aaaa\") and the generated string BBB is \"aaaa\"\n(2,4)(2, 4)(2,4): the input is (\"abcb\", \"bcba\") and BBB is \"abbccbba\"\n(3,4)(3, 4)(3,4): the input is (\"abcb\", \"bcba\") and BBB is \"abbccbba\"\n(4,2)(4, 2)(4,2): the input is (\"bcba\", \"abcb\") and BBB is \"bacbbcab\"\n(4,3)(4, 3)(4,3): the input is (\"bcba\", \"abcb\") and BBB is \"bacbbcab\""
      }
